{"id":"vod_bf_151471","vodId":"151471","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"提欧奥特曼","name_cn":"提欧奥特曼","date":"2026-01-01","year":"2026","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第15集","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20260704-1/836c9791dffa943399fff37e2a4adfab.webp"},"summary":"宇宙某处的行星“H12” 这颗与地球极其相似的星球，某日遭到了来自外星的宇宙怪兽袭击 在星球崩毁、走向灭亡之际，一名外星人独自逃往了地球 他的名字是“提欧”——一个孤单的外星灵魂，终将蜕变成“奥特曼” 他化身为明心大学兽医学部兽医学科三年级的学生“光石息吹”。尽管他仍难以适应地球人的常识，但却能与心爱的动物们心灵相通，过着平静的大学校园生活 然而，曾经摧毁他家乡的宇宙怪兽突然现身，地球危机迫在眉睫 当“想要守护”的强烈念头，振奋了那颗畏惧过去记忆的心时，耀眼的光芒将息吹的身姿变成了——蓝色的光之巨人！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-10-17 09:15:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/d091f8e7307c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/832571dc7a74/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/1ce1f76a02ea/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/326add3ab541/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/53885acbf8a2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://bfeng11.com/video/tiouaoteman/ee1fcc139f1a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/e82860ae2ad0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7.5集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/e37eaf439a2b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/4c45459ac391/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/1cd50cc7318e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/4b072119e60d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/f3f6e512ead7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://fengbao12.com/video/tiouaoteman/98ed7ff9887b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://fengbao13.com/video/tiouaoteman/606e52f88709/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","